# Host build artifacts must never leak into the Linux image: the
# Dockerfile runs `npm ci` + `npm run build` itself. Copying a host
# (e.g. Windows) node_modules/.next over the fresh install can break
# native binaries and makes the build context huge and non-reproducible.
# Root rules plus Docker `**` recursive rules (P3-04): nested package
# layouts are covered too. Verified against the real Docker matcher by
# the opt-in gate in tests/integration/test_m5_docker_e2e.py.
node_modules
.next
npm-debug.log*
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/npm-debug.log*
